        "critique_and_reasoning": "Contradicting the plugin's actual label muddled the explanation for casual listeners. Pitch correction is the broader technical category, whereas the actual contrast being demonstrated is real-time automatic correction versus manual graphical editing."
      },
      "findingType": "unexplained_jargon",
      "severity": "low",
      "score": 3,
      "suggestion": "Clarify the terms in plain English: 'Pitch correction is the umbrella category. What people call Auto-Tune is automatic real-time correction, whereas what we are about to do is manual graphical tuning where an engineer adjusts each note by hand.'",
