        "quote": "see where it goes down there you see you can't really really fix that little bit there but you can try and chop it",
        "critique_and_reasoning": "Splitting the tail end of the drifted note and manually nudging only the flat portion into pitch perfectly illustrates why manual pitch correction sounds completely seamless. It delivers directly on the video's core premise with an intuitive, audible payoff."
      },
      "findingType": "clear_breakdown",
      "severity": "none",
      "score": 5,
      "suggestion": "",
      "sources": [],
