      "endMs": 952000,
      "evidence": {
        "quote": "If you're a singer, you can sing in tune, can't you? Can you not sing in tune? If you can't sing in tune, you're not a singer",
        "critique_and_reasoning": "Pivoting from a friendly educational walkthrough into an aggressive gatekeeping rant breaks the established warm tone. It risks alienating singers and aspiring artists in your audience who utilize corrective tools during production."
